WEBVTT

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:13.060
She became a God.

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:14.060
Nene?

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.330
What is it, Linna?

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:19.410
How long do you think our inner-metal will last?

00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:23.440
I don't know, but it probably won't last that long.

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:26.100
Do you think we'll be able to get back up there?

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:30.180
No, we look like we're not moving,

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:33.340
but we're flying toward Earth at
high speed due to the explosion.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:36.220
Soon, we'll speed up more as
Earth's gravity affects us.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:38.690
What? What do you mean by that?!

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:43.390
Are you saying that we're going to
crash into the Earth and splatter?

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:45.290
Possibly.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:46.730
Possibly? Maybe?!

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:50.560
Oh, no! Can we do anything about it? Well?!

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:54.470
Priss, are you going to fight by yourself?

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:24.670
Galatea!

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:31.770
Damn it.

00:01:36.550 --> 00:01:38.250
Ridiculous imitation!

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:41.650
What the hell are you saying?

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:45.510
What the hell did you do to me?!

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:27.890
Who are you?

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:31.130
Sylia, right?

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:35.710
Yes, I'm Sylia. Who are you?

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:37.880
Me?

00:02:40.610 --> 00:02:43.550
I... I wonder who I am?

00:02:49.090 --> 00:02:52.420
My name is Priss, Priss Asagiri.

00:02:53.390 --> 00:02:56.620
Priss? I like that name.

00:02:57.730 --> 00:02:58.960
Where is this place?

00:02:59.070 --> 00:03:02.400
Momma's house, but she's not at home now.

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:08.000
Is this place inside of Galatea's memory?

00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:11.510
A memory of when Galatea existed
solely inside of Sylia's brain?

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:12.980
Yes.

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:14.100
A human being

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:18.240
is just a system controlled by the
electrical activities in its brain.

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:20.480
It can be reduced to mere information.

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:23.490
What the hell are you talking about?

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:26.680
I was born from Sylia's brain.

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:29.690
Now, the opposite situation is occurring.

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:34.430
The anti-seed, which exists
in the core of the boomer,

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:36.260
is you, Priss.

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:47.410
Vital organic functions have been
taken over by the boomers.

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:52.610
Your mind and body have been
dedicated to boomers, Priss.

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:54.120
No way...

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:21.180
What's the matter?

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:26.280
I wonder what I can do to save them?

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:30.160
It's funny

00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:34.660
that Earth's fate will be decided
by such ill-mannered girls.

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:35.820
Isn't it?

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:40.800
Let's go. I want to let them
rest as soon as possible.

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:49.770
If there was a way to help them...

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:53.140
Nene, we're going to be in serious trouble!

00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:57.940
What will we do? What can we
do to be able to land safely?

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:02.850
The boomer who is holding me,

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:06.160
please release yourself from
whatever controls you.

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:08.130
What are you saying?

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:11.260
Change me, boomer.

00:05:22.910 --> 00:05:25.640
Nene, it's as if you were...

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:27.810
Think as I'm doing, Linna.

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:29.640
I wonder if I can?

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:31.840
You will.

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:37.790
Hard suit, I accept you as a boomer.

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:40.090
So please protect me.

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:01.770
Priss!

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:12.520
I am already in Galatea.

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:17.700
Galatea and I are looking at the same thing.

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:22.760
What's that?

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:27.740
Nene... Linna...

00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:32.970
I see now.

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:36.580
It's not over yet!

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:46.190
I am not you!

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:48.280
I am different!

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:26.020
Foreign substance in the body.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:28.960
Activating immune system.

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:41.010
Galatea!

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:44.780
No more fooling around!

00:07:46.550 --> 00:07:48.610
No! My metal...

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:52.120
Don't run out at a time like this!

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:05.300
Damn! My oxygen is running out now, isn't it?

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:09.140
Is this the end?!

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:16.510
I... I want more power!

00:08:39.770 --> 00:08:41.900
Nene!

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:47.970
A little bit longer.

00:09:00.190 --> 00:09:02.390
You want power, don't you?

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:04.730
Who's there?

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:09.930
Please order me to have my own will.

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:15.270
Your own will? You may have
anything like that you want.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:34.650
Please accept me as usual.

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:36.720
Who is this?

00:09:44.340 --> 00:09:47.030
Please put me on, Priss.

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:50.070
Motoslave?

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:11.630
You're alive, aren't you?

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:14.320
Because of the shock when
crashing into the skyhook,

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:17.200
thirty-five percent of my function has been lost.

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:20.840
Battery metal hasn't remained as strong.

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:25.240
I want to finish this as soon
as possible, of course!

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:31.610
Incredible! I can move so fast.

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:36.490
But I'm going to smash your god, you know?

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:39.720
The master I serve is you, Priss.

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:42.290
For me, you are the mast...

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:45.690
Cut it out. I'm not a person like that!

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:09.650
This boomer wants to be God for mankind?!

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:11.380
Don't think so highly of yourself!

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:19.530
Why?

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:24.730
Why do you persist in trying
to remain a human being?

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:28.240
As long as human beings remain as they are,

00:11:28.340 --> 00:11:31.440
neither mind nor body can evolve.

00:11:32.510 --> 00:11:34.100
So, why?

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:35.540
I don't understand.

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:10.580
Finally, Galatea has gone insane.

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:13.880
No, she is speeding up her evolution.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:18.720
Priss!

00:12:39.510 --> 00:12:42.410
Priss, are you all right?

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:45.610
You're worse off than I am!

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:48.120
Hurry up! The metal is running out.

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:20.180
Motoslave, can you be with me until the end?

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:21.080
Yes.

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:23.620
Well then, let's go.

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:24.550
Yes.

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:11.160
Galatea, this is a present from all humankind.

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:29.950
Motoslave!

00:14:35.730 --> 00:14:37.320
Death?

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:38.420
Die?

00:14:41.070 --> 00:14:43.300
No, reproduction.

00:14:45.370 --> 00:14:50.100
Revive the evidence of being God.

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:28.240
I found the right path of evolution.

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:35.220
What?

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:38.580
When Priss entered into me,

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:43.650
when my consciousness was
born in Sylia's brain,

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:48.670
my existence became eternal.

00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:52.930
That's the real assimilation.

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:59.940
I will be in everything. That's
the real form of God.

00:16:01.010 --> 00:16:03.240
I don't care anymore.

00:16:21.300 --> 00:16:23.270
It's kind of beautiful.

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:30.440
It's very beautiful.

00:17:29.300 --> 00:17:32.270
A tremendous amount of neutrino
radiation has been observed,

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:35.530
and the government has quickly
formed an investigative committee,

00:17:35.640 --> 00:17:37.580
to try to discover the cause of this phenomenon.

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:41.070
Priss...

00:17:47.150 --> 00:17:48.780
Don't you want to go home?

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:53.120
Sure, I do, but I think it's too late.

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:58.650
Priss, accept me and let me enter into you.

00:18:46.280 --> 00:18:48.540
Mackey, are you...

00:18:58.560 --> 00:18:59.790
Mackey...

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:04.090
Sylia...

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:11.130
My God!

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:39.720
Even though people are there

00:19:41.330 --> 00:19:46.400
People are here as well

00:19:47.340 --> 00:19:57.340
I want to connect all of the small miracles

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:12.020
The door to tomorrow will be opened

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:18.470
Sha la la la la...

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:23.340
This planet is gentle, so

00:20:24.880 --> 00:20:35.410
Let my exhausted body be released

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:41.060
Time in the history

00:20:41.990 --> 00:20:47.060
On the morning of shooting stars

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:52.700
By being wrapped in the wind
